===== quadcam-cli stage --help
Copy every clip off a card or folder into staging and start a new session

Usage: quadcam-cli stage [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  Card mount point or folder. Default: the first detected card

Options:
      --json            Print one JSON object: {"ok":true,"result":...} or {"ok":false,"error":{...}}
      --no-join         Keep recordings the DVR split into files as separate clips this run (the join_split_recordings setting is on by default)
      --session <FILE>  Session file (default: ~/Library/Caches/app.quadcam/session.json)
  -h, --help            Print help
