===== quadcam-cli dates --help
Date clips from radio logs, and override dates and times per clip

Usage: quadcam-cli dates [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json             Print one JSON object: {"ok":true,"result":...} or {"ok":false,"error":{...}}
      --logs <LOGS>      EdgeTX LOGS folder or the radio's root
      --no-logs          Ignore radio logs; every clip gets the import date
      --session <FILE>   Session file (default: ~/Library/Caches/app.quadcam/session.json)
      --day <DAY>        Log day to match against (YYYY-MM-DD). Default: newest plausible day
      --set <ID=DATE>    Override one clip's date: ID=YYYY-MM-DD. Repeatable
      --time <ID=HH:MM>  Set one clip's time of day: ID=HH:MM ("ID=" for noon). Repeatable
  -h, --help             Print help
