      --session <FILE>  Session file (default: ~/Library/Caches/app.quadcam/session.json)
  -h, --help            Print help
===== quadcam-cli gear devices --help
Saved devices: list (default), save a name or aircraft, forget

Usage: quadcam-cli gear devices [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    List the saved devices
  save    Name a device or link it to an aircraft profile. A new device must be plugged in
  forget  Remove a device from the list. Its backups stay
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json            Print one JSON object: {"ok":true,"result":...} or {"ok":false,"error":{...}}
      --session <FILE>  Session file (default: ~/Library/Caches/app.quadcam/session.json)
  -h, --help            Print help
