===== quadcam-cli gear fc --help
A Betaflight flight controller: identify, read, check, board notes, USB timer

Usage: quadcam-cli gear fc [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  identify  Read the FC's identity over MSP: board, firmware, version, device id. No reboot
  read      Read through the CLI (read-only commands). The FC reboots when the read ends
  check     Offline: every CLI line of EXPECTED must appear verbatim in the `diff all` file
  notes     Known issues of FC boards and builds
  usb       Each FC's USB heat timer, as the app last read it
  pause     Pause the running app's own reads of an FC (the USB timer's probe, the on-connect backup) so another tool can have the port. Lasts until the app quits
  resume    Resume the app's reads of an FC
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json            Print one JSON object: {"ok":true,"result":...} or {"ok":false,"error":{...}}
      --session <FILE>  Session file (default: ~/Library/Caches/app.quadcam/session.json)
  -h, --help            Print help
===== quadcam-cli gear fc identify --help
Read the FC's identity over MSP: board, firmware, version, device id. No reboot

Usage: quadcam-cli gear fc identify [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json            Print one JSON object: {"ok":true,"result":...} or {"ok":false,"error":{...}}
      --port <PORT>     The FC's port (/dev/cu.usbmodem...); omit when one FC is plugged in
      --session <FILE>  Session file (default: ~/Library/Caches/app.quadcam/session.json)
  -h, --help            Print help
===== quadcam-cli gear fc read --help
Read through the CLI (read-only commands). The FC reboots when the read ends

Usage: quadcam-cli gear fc read [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json            Print one JSON object: {"ok":true,"result":...} or {"ok":false,"error":{...}}
      --port <PORT>     
      --cmd <COMMANDS>  A read-only command (repeat it): version, status, get NAME, diff all, dump all. Default: version, status, diff all, dump all
      --session <FILE>  Session file (default: ~/Library/Caches/app.quadcam/session.json)
      --out <OUT>       Also write each `diff all` and `dump all` to <OUT>.diff_all.txt and <OUT>.dump_all.txt. Refuses to overwrite a file
  -h, --help            Print help
