===== quadcam-cli gear map --help
The switch map: what each radio control does on the radio and the FC, per position. Reads an EdgeTX card or model file and a Betaflight dump; --live marks the positions now

Usage: quadcam-cli gear map [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json                 Print one JSON object: {"ok":true,"result":...} or {"ok":false,"error":{...}}
      --radio <RADIO>        An EdgeTX card (mount or folder) or one model file
      --model <MODEL>        The model file on the card (model01.yml); default: the radio's selected model
      --session <FILE>       Session file (default: ~/Library/Caches/app.quadcam/session.json)
      --fc <FC>              Betaflight dump, diff or CLI files, read in order (a later file's lines win)
      --aircraft <AIRCRAFT>  An aircraft profile: the latest backups of its saved radio and FC
      --device <DEVICES>     A saved device whose latest backup to read (an FC or a radio); repeat for both
      --live                 Mark where each control is now: the FC's channels, else the radio's joystick
      --port <PORT>          The FC's port for --live; omit when one FC is plugged in
      --channels <CHANNELS>  Channel values to mark instead, µs, CH1 first (1500,1500,988,...)
      --text                 Print the map as text instead of the structured view
  -h, --help                 Print help
